{
  "label": "mollyfirsthall",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label mollyfirsthall:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall1.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Molly. What are you up to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Afternoon, Sir!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I decided to be adventurous this fine evening and journey outside of my room.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, really? Are you going somewhere?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Negative, Sir. This is as far as I am willing to go.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In order to break the NEET mold, I must stand in this very hallway for at least an hour once a week.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What a coincidence that you just happened to show up on that very day!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, I show up on other days too. I don’t think it’s that strange of a coincidence.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall2.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tell me, Sir. Do you believe in fate?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel like I’ve answered this question for someone else before.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I believe, Sir. I believe we were fated to meet in this very hallway.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is a gift from the Heavens above! Or the Hells below! Whichever you believe in!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And if we don’t believe in either?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then find something to believe in!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or better yet, believe in me!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh! Even better than that-",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Believe in the me that believes in you!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, what the fuck are you even talking about?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall3.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I JUST SHOTGUNNED A MONSTER AND I’M READY TO KICK ASS! LET’S GO!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you’re going to ask someone to believe in you instead of heaven or hell, you’re going to need better reasoning than “I just shotgunned a monster.”",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall2.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let’s face it, Sir. You’ll believe in Molly MacCormack whether she gives you a good reason or not.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And why is that?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall4.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because cute girls are more powerful than God! Especially ones with green thigh-high’s named Molly!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And as further proof, I’ll have you know that I killed several gods just earlier today in a video game I was playing.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So if that’s not enough reason for you to worship me, I don’t know what is.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you...starting a cult or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall5.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. But it’s a totally wholesome one and I’m not going to ask you to pray or donate or anything.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We can just hang out, eat junk food, and watch movies.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That...actually sounds like a pretty sweet deal.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The sweetest deal, Sir.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And where can I sign up for this so-called “Cult of Molly?”",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall4.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All I need is eight ounces of your blood. That is enough to perform the ritual.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall5.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll also need you to sign a few papers.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I like to keep things organized, Sir. And without proper documentation for each and every member, things are bound to get wild.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just look at Christianity, Sir. There are like ten different kinds now. Would that really have happened if everyone had to sign a form?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...Probably?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall2.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nonsense! Malarky!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Real religion is like a gym membership. You sign up ‘cause you think it’s cool and then wind up forgetting about it and ultimately stop caring altogether.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The Cult of Molly, though...That’s where things become different.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall4.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Together, we’ll usher in the end of times! The last of days! The...ending of...stuff!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You need to chill out with the energy drinks, Molly. Your enthusiasm is going to tear this place down.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall3.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let it burn for all I care! I’ll move in with you and Ami!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You two would have to sleep in the same bed.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall6.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I hope she likes cuddling, Sir. I tend to grab onto things when I sleep, you see.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s a habit I’ve had since birth.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think it’s because I’m so full of love that it possesses me in my sleep.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's either that or a demon.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It could be either one, Sir.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s nice, Molly.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall7.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Gah!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Molly’s cell phone suddenly rings from inside of her pocket, causing her to jump up in surprise.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall8.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who the heck is textin’ me at this time of night? Don’t they know that the latest update is supposed to drop in-",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall9.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": AH! RIGHT NOW!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall10.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sir...I apologize for cutting this meeting short, but it appears that I have prior engagements.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Go play your game, Molly. I’ll just find something else to do.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Roger. Please feel free to visit me again soon, though!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Preferably on a day where I don’t have games to play!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollyhall11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollyhall11.webp",
      "alt": "mollyhall11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How am I supposed to know when that is?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I wind up walking around the area surrounding the dorms for a few minutes afterward, hoping to bump into another familiar face.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Unfortunately, I don’t find anything and am forced to go home early...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh well, I guess.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "At least Molly’s probably having a good night.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ molly_love += 1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ mollyfirsthall = True",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Molly’s affection has increased to [molly_love]!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if day < 6:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump endofweekday",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump endofsat",
      "zh": ""
    }
  ]
}